//   056 Viktor invites the family to dig potatoes in Kõrvemaa — the radio forecast (listening), how the weather
//       changes; four seasons on Viktor's farm, Oskar's weather diary; Saturday or Sunday? (a call, a group message).
//   057 the family's hike in Viru raba — the trail's notice board, kuhu / kus / kust; on the boardwalk (listening),
//       three trails, Oskar's story; a nature day with Olena and Daria (the visitor centre on the phone, a message).
//   058 a storm at Viktor's farm — the storm warning on the radio (listening), cause and result; the local paper,
//       Jaan calls Viktor (listening); the insurance: a call and a damage report.
//   059 the green week at Tuul Logistika — Liis's letter, opinion + reason + example, the object; a repair café on the
//       radio (listening), Jelena's kitchen rules; the module project: Kalamaja talgud.
